OL,3,GNEWSAMum's plea to end jail terms with
OL,4,Ano end date after son dies in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a man who died in prison
OL,7,Fwhile serving a sentence with no end
OL,8,Fdate, are demanding immediate action to
OL,9,Fend what they have described as
OL,10,F"torturous" indefinite prison terms.
OL,12,FJosh Mcrae, was one of five men serving
OL,13,FImprisonment for Public Protection
OL,14,F(IPP) sentences, whose cases were the
OL,15,Fsubject of a recent landmark United
OL,16,FNations review, that found their
OL,17,Fcontinued detention was "arbitrary".
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
